WEBVTT

00:00:01.450 --> 00:00:05.340
120 minutes after the operation began.

00:00:13.530 --> 00:00:15.950
Everywhere I look, all 
I can see are Wulgaru!

00:00:18.260 --> 00:00:19.830
Black 6, are you all right?

00:00:20.080 --> 00:00:23.130
I'm just starting to get pumped up!

00:00:23.140 --> 00:00:26.230
I'm gonna have a blast taking 
out all of these bogeys!

00:00:34.610 --> 00:00:36.970
Black 6, don't lose sight of the goal.

00:00:37.370 --> 00:00:40.560
Our mission is to launch 
our markers into the gate.

00:00:40.830 --> 00:00:43.660
Gosh darn it! If we knew 
this was gonna happen,

00:00:43.660 --> 00:00:45.850
we shoulda gone with them!

00:00:50.300 --> 00:00:52.780
The three units in the vanguard 
have been completely surrounded!

00:00:53.090 --> 00:00:54.550
The enemy is composed of two fleets,

00:00:54.550 --> 00:00:57.570
but the number of ships is 
double what we normally see!

00:00:57.890 --> 00:00:59.470
Notify all fleets!

00:00:59.470 --> 00:01:01.820
Excluding Star Rose's Escort Force,

00:01:01.820 --> 00:01:05.500
everyone is to offer Team Rabbits 
their utmost support straightaway!

00:01:14.190 --> 00:01:16.610
This isn't going according 
to plan at all...

00:01:16.820 --> 00:01:18.510
I never dreamed this might happen.

00:01:18.820 --> 00:01:21.540
As soon as we enter 
range, commence fire!

00:01:21.540 --> 00:01:22.390
Roger!

00:01:25.250 --> 00:01:27.790
I'm sure you must be worried 
about Asagi and the others,

00:01:27.790 --> 00:01:29.730
but you can't run out after them.

00:01:30.090 --> 00:01:31.550
That's why the captain wanted to

00:01:31.550 --> 00:01:34.110
keep you somewhere she 
could keep an eye on you.

00:01:34.110 --> 00:01:35.330
That's right!

00:01:35.330 --> 00:01:38.790
I want to go out and help, 
but I'm staying here, too!

00:01:38.790 --> 00:01:39.740
I know.

00:01:40.310 --> 00:01:43.390
I have every intention of 
fulfilling my own mission!

00:01:44.130 --> 00:01:45.160
It's just...

00:01:45.640 --> 00:01:48.480
Don't you think this is a bit much?

00:01:49.060 --> 00:01:52.650
Izuru, you have a past record 
of going against orders, so...

00:03:24.950 --> 00:03:29.380
"Operation: Heaven's Gate"

00:03:31.210 --> 00:03:35.680
30 minutes before the operation.

00:03:31.920 --> 00:03:35.110
After analyzing the data that 
Team Doberman retrieved,

00:03:36.000 --> 00:03:40.030
we deduced that the gate's energy 
control system is located here.

00:03:40.380 --> 00:03:44.180
Our mission's ultimate goal is 
to destroy this control system.

00:03:44.350 --> 00:03:47.120
If we do, the gate will destroy itself.

00:03:48.060 --> 00:03:49.490
Team Rabbits, your mission is to

00:03:49.490 --> 00:03:52.340
approach the gate without 
drawing the Wulgaru's attention

00:03:52.340 --> 00:03:56.360
and fire these target markers 
into the control system.

00:03:56.360 --> 00:03:57.750
All of Earth's forces will

00:03:57.750 --> 00:04:00.070
use your target markers as 
a guide for where to fire.

00:04:01.110 --> 00:04:02.880
The forward units that will 
charge the gate include:

00:04:02.880 --> 00:04:05.470
Blue 1, Rose 3 and Black 6.

00:04:05.810 --> 00:04:08.950
Purple 2 will serve as a 
mid-fielder and Gold 4 will

00:04:08.950 --> 00:04:10.290
offer support from the rear.

00:04:10.750 --> 00:04:13.080
All units will be equipped 
with the target markers.

00:04:13.080 --> 00:04:15.880
In the end, I don't care who tries 
to shoot one into the control system.

00:04:15.880 --> 00:04:19.090
Once you make a direct hit, Team 
Rabbits' mission will be over.

00:04:19.940 --> 00:04:21.860
We've been assigned a critical role...

00:04:22.340 --> 00:04:26.010
If we fail, they won't be 
able to destroy the gate.

00:04:26.010 --> 00:04:27.420
Once we fire the marker,

00:04:27.420 --> 00:04:29.080
I suspect the enemy fleets 
will come out after us.

00:04:29.350 --> 00:04:30.680
I should think so.

00:04:30.680 --> 00:04:33.270
Earth's fleets will be 
quick to engage in battle,

00:04:33.270 --> 00:04:36.380
so pull away from the gate 
as quickly as possible.

00:04:36.720 --> 00:04:40.670
As you're already aware, Red 5 can't 
participate in this operation.

00:04:41.030 --> 00:04:42.440
Asagi will be the leader.

00:04:42.440 --> 00:04:43.590
Understood.

00:04:49.160 --> 00:04:51.680
Team Rabbits, blast off!

00:05:08.050 --> 00:05:09.570
Big Brother, fight!

00:05:10.560 --> 00:05:11.410
Fight!

00:05:14.940 --> 00:05:17.540
The Straggle Laser is entering 
position preparatory to fire.

00:05:18.110 --> 00:05:19.930
Energy circuits, connected!

00:05:19.930 --> 00:05:21.960
It's currently advancing 
toward the first stage.

00:05:22.320 --> 00:05:25.990
After we destroy the gate, there 
is no saying what may happen.

00:05:26.660 --> 00:05:28.260
But if everything goes 
according to plan,

00:05:28.260 --> 00:05:30.260
casualties will be at a minimum.

00:05:30.260 --> 00:05:32.910
Really, it all rests on 
how my brother responds.

00:05:33.410 --> 00:05:35.390
Are you referring to Pleguzes Jiart?

00:05:35.830 --> 00:05:39.090
He discovered that Lady Teoria 
has allied herself with Earth.

00:05:39.460 --> 00:05:42.320
We are unable to predict his next move.

00:05:42.630 --> 00:05:45.280
I am prepared to face my brother,

00:05:46.050 --> 00:05:48.390
although I do not know if I 
am capable of stopping him...

00:05:51.640 --> 00:05:54.620
I can see something!
Is that the gate?

00:06:00.810 --> 00:06:02.210
Ma'am, look!

00:06:02.570 --> 00:06:03.920
Something just came out!

00:06:03.980 --> 00:06:05.360
Did they lay an ambush?!

00:06:05.360 --> 00:06:08.340
No, it doesn't look like 
they're in a battle formation.

00:06:08.660 --> 00:06:12.330
We probably bumped into them 
right as they were setting out!

00:06:13.700 --> 00:06:15.350
What are they doing here?!

00:06:15.890 --> 00:06:20.320
My, my! Did they come 
to vandalize our gate?

00:06:21.630 --> 00:06:23.860
I'll have to torture 
them to the fullest.

00:06:36.580 --> 00:06:38.870
Everywhere I look, all 
I can see are Wulgaru!

00:06:41.310 --> 00:06:42.710
Black 6, are you all right?

00:06:43.000 --> 00:06:46.010
I'm just starting to get pumped up!

00:06:46.010 --> 00:06:48.970
I'm gonna have a blast taking 
out all of these bogeys!

00:06:51.770 --> 00:06:53.640
We have to get near that gate somehow!

00:06:53.870 --> 00:06:56.180
How the heck is "somehow"?!

00:06:57.960 --> 00:06:59.100
I'm on fire!

00:06:59.510 --> 00:07:02.140
I'm on fire! I'm friggin' on fire!

00:07:12.140 --> 00:07:14.430
Team Rabbits has crossed the half line.

00:07:14.430 --> 00:07:16.680
Remaining distance to the gate: 50%.

00:07:16.680 --> 00:07:18.850
However, due to the enemy's 
current interference,

00:07:18.850 --> 00:07:20.790
their progress has 
decelerated tremendously.

00:07:21.150 --> 00:07:23.100
This encounter was like getting 
thrown a curve ball...

00:07:23.530 --> 00:07:26.630
But I suppose we're lucky that 
we took them by surprise.

00:07:26.900 --> 00:07:30.400
Gold 4, support the forward three 
units with long-distance sniper shots!

00:07:30.400 --> 00:07:33.640
Purple 2, send the enemy 
fleets' coordinates to Gold 4.

00:07:36.120 --> 00:07:38.570
Kei, also include the order of priority!

00:07:38.570 --> 00:07:39.890
Roger! Sent!

00:07:40.640 --> 00:07:42.020
Wow, most impressive!

00:07:42.420 --> 00:07:45.440
Asagi, Tamaki, Ange, you just sit tight!

00:07:50.450 --> 00:07:52.200
That's Gold 4 lending us a hand!

00:07:55.760 --> 00:07:57.080
Suruga's pretty good!

00:08:00.310 --> 00:08:01.980
The enemy's formation is falling apart!

00:08:01.980 --> 00:08:03.520
Now is our chance to split up!

00:08:03.520 --> 00:08:04.440
Got it!

00:08:04.440 --> 00:08:05.810
Let's go!

00:08:08.400 --> 00:08:10.280
We have to succeed, no matter what!

00:08:10.280 --> 00:08:11.630
For Izuru and for Earth!

00:08:21.160 --> 00:08:24.580
Purple 2, Gold 4, advance 
with Earth's fleets!

00:08:24.580 --> 00:08:25.310
Roger!

00:08:30.880 --> 00:08:32.520
It would appear that fleets from

00:08:32.520 --> 00:08:34.650
several of the economic 
powers are trailing behind.

00:08:34.650 --> 00:08:38.450
Are they trying to conserve their 
forces at a time like this?

00:08:38.850 --> 00:08:41.350
Ignore the lagging fleets 
and proceed forward.

00:08:41.350 --> 00:08:43.690
They won't be able to 
remain quiet once we

00:08:43.690 --> 00:08:45.830
start to inflict damage 
on the enemy fleets!

00:08:50.320 --> 00:08:50.960
Fire!

00:08:56.570 --> 00:08:59.030
The fleets in the rear 
have begun to advance.

00:08:59.620 --> 00:09:01.450
They won't want to explain 
why they have zero

00:09:01.450 --> 00:09:03.310
accomplishments once 
the operation is over.

00:09:03.620 --> 00:09:05.070
Continue the bombardment!

00:09:05.070 --> 00:09:08.360
If Team Rabbits doesn't reach 
the gate, Earth is finished!

00:09:16.220 --> 00:09:19.850
Amazing! It looks like 
a fireworks display.

00:09:19.850 --> 00:09:23.540
All of Earth's forces 
are working to help us.

00:09:24.520 --> 00:09:26.460
I'd say the Fail Five have 
gone up in the world.

00:09:29.060 --> 00:09:31.010
A whole bunch of them just showed up!

00:09:31.010 --> 00:09:32.490
I'll draw their attention!

00:09:32.490 --> 00:09:33.830
I want you to head for the gate.

00:09:40.700 --> 00:09:42.100
That unit's here!

00:09:42.910 --> 00:09:45.300
That's the one that took out Patrick!

00:09:47.370 --> 00:09:49.770
I wonder if that blue unit is tasty.

00:10:09.810 --> 00:10:10.670
What are you doing?!

00:10:11.110 --> 00:10:13.590
This defeats the whole point 
of me being the decoy!

00:10:15.070 --> 00:10:17.800
My, would you like to dance with me?

00:10:19.570 --> 00:10:21.240
Tamaki, come back!

00:10:23.740 --> 00:10:25.450
I will help Tamaki from here.

00:10:25.450 --> 00:10:27.050
Continue toward the gate!

00:10:27.050 --> 00:10:28.170
Got it.

00:10:28.750 --> 00:10:30.770
Tamaki, don't do anything crazy.

00:10:34.510 --> 00:10:37.010
Lutiel's fleet is 
beginning to fall apart.

00:10:37.010 --> 00:10:38.430
They are going to break our defenses!

00:10:39.130 --> 00:10:40.420
Curse you, Lutiel!

00:10:40.420 --> 00:10:42.350
It is not yet time for you to fight!

00:10:42.350 --> 00:10:43.930
Tighten the formation!

00:10:43.930 --> 00:10:45.540
Force the Earthlings back!

00:10:46.230 --> 00:10:48.480
Break the enemy fleets into groups!

00:10:48.480 --> 00:10:50.460
Focus your fire on the weak 
points in their formations.

00:11:02.540 --> 00:11:05.380
Launch the carrier-based 
units! Protect Blue 1!

00:11:10.250 --> 00:11:12.190
Don't let him near the gate!

00:11:13.810 --> 00:11:17.360
Not on my watch!

00:11:23.470 --> 00:11:25.500
We have received orders 
from King Galkie.

00:11:25.970 --> 00:11:29.620
He says to assist both 
Dolgana and Lutiel's fleets.

00:11:30.100 --> 00:11:32.040
Apparently the Earthlings have

00:11:32.040 --> 00:11:34.080
invested their remaining 
forces in this battle.

00:11:34.400 --> 00:11:35.750
Sir, so it would seem.

00:11:36.150 --> 00:11:38.540
Inform me when my lamata 
makes an appearance.

00:11:39.110 --> 00:11:40.760
I will leave the fleet 
in your hands until then.

00:11:41.020 --> 00:11:43.330
Prince Jiart, are you 
not going to sortie?

00:11:43.780 --> 00:11:46.330
Small fry may contend 
with the small fry.

00:11:46.330 --> 00:11:47.220
Very well.

00:11:48.410 --> 00:11:54.320
We shall have a private 
party of our own, my lamata!

00:12:16.900 --> 00:12:19.320
The Straggle Laser is currently in 
its second stage preparation to fire.

00:12:19.320 --> 00:12:21.340
Energy charged at 80%.

00:12:21.570 --> 00:12:23.240
It will be ready to fire momentarily.

00:12:23.950 --> 00:12:25.820
Blue 1 is exploiting openings 
in the enemy's fleets

00:12:25.820 --> 00:12:27.370
to head toward the gate.

00:12:27.370 --> 00:12:29.150
He has already passed the quarter line,

00:12:29.150 --> 00:12:30.520
so he has a fourth of the way to go.

00:12:31.020 --> 00:12:32.670
How is the battle progressing?

00:12:32.670 --> 00:12:35.270
I would have a hard time saying 
that things looks favorable.

00:12:35.460 --> 00:12:38.380
The Earthlings are certainly dominating.

00:12:38.380 --> 00:12:40.600
However, if they cannot reach the gate,

00:12:40.600 --> 00:12:42.190
all will have been for naught.

00:12:45.090 --> 00:12:47.640
Rose 3 is throwing the enemy's 
formation into disarray.

00:12:47.890 --> 00:12:50.310
Blue 1 is approaching 
the gate by himself!

00:12:50.310 --> 00:12:53.540
Increase fire! We can't 
afford to let them die!

00:12:56.110 --> 00:12:58.270
A mid-range gun battle, huh?

00:12:58.730 --> 00:13:01.230
This feels like a boxing 
match, doesn't it?

00:13:01.230 --> 00:13:04.610
As in whoever stops moving 
first gets pummeled?

00:13:06.280 --> 00:13:09.470
Delivery! I've brought 
rice balls for everyone!

00:13:09.950 --> 00:13:11.290
It's the lunch lady...

00:13:11.290 --> 00:13:12.890
Shion, you decided to stay, too?

00:13:13.210 --> 00:13:14.960
They needed the extra help.

00:13:14.960 --> 00:13:17.190
Everyone has to do whatever they can!

00:13:17.590 --> 00:13:19.840
Yeah, but still, a delivery...?

00:13:19.840 --> 00:13:21.130
Is this really the time for that?

00:13:21.130 --> 00:13:23.110
Eat while you still can.

00:13:23.340 --> 00:13:25.690
I imagine we won't have time 
for food before much longer.

00:13:26.260 --> 00:13:28.100
I'd like something low on calories...

00:13:28.100 --> 00:13:29.980
Okay. I made a healthy set

00:13:29.980 --> 00:13:32.900
with pickled plums, natto, 
and saké lee pickles.

00:13:32.900 --> 00:13:35.540
Uh, well, I don't really like natto...

00:13:35.850 --> 00:13:37.310
I'll take that!

00:13:37.310 --> 00:13:39.150
Do you have anything with foie gras?

00:13:39.150 --> 00:13:40.480
I'll take the saké lee pickles!

00:13:40.480 --> 00:13:42.460
Okay! I'll hand them out to everyone.

00:13:42.570 --> 00:13:44.310
Great! I appreciate it.

00:13:44.310 --> 00:13:46.780
Izuru, you have a job of your own to do.

00:13:46.780 --> 00:13:47.800
Th-that's right!

00:13:50.690 --> 00:13:51.740
Here is your tea!

00:13:52.160 --> 00:13:53.140
Thank you.

00:13:53.450 --> 00:13:54.370
Here!

00:13:54.370 --> 00:13:55.060
Thanks.

00:13:56.080 --> 00:13:57.170
Here! Here!

00:13:57.170 --> 00:13:58.250
Danke schön.

00:13:58.250 --> 00:14:00.960
We should all go hang 
out when this is over.

00:14:00.960 --> 00:14:01.730
Yeah! Oomph!

00:14:02.550 --> 00:14:04.880
This is Gold 4! I need more artillery.

00:14:04.880 --> 00:14:06.530
Please send me some additional weapons.

00:14:06.880 --> 00:14:08.140
Do we have any backup weapons?

00:14:08.140 --> 00:14:10.010
Rather than mount whatever 
we have lying around,

00:14:10.010 --> 00:14:13.310
let's link our ship's Weapons 
Control System directly to Gold 4.

00:14:13.310 --> 00:14:14.950
It'll be quicker that way.

00:14:15.560 --> 00:14:17.390
Let's split Godinion in half

00:14:17.390 --> 00:14:20.360
and use the front half's Battle 
Module as a moving fortress.

00:14:20.360 --> 00:14:22.750
It's programmed to handle 
situations just like this!

00:14:22.980 --> 00:14:24.280
Got it.

00:14:24.280 --> 00:14:26.900
Detach the Godinion's 
front Battle Module and

00:14:26.900 --> 00:14:29.170
entrust Gold 4 with the 
Weapons Control System!

00:14:29.170 --> 00:14:29.720
Roger!

00:14:30.290 --> 00:14:31.350
Asagi...

00:14:31.870 --> 00:14:33.260
Everyone, fight!

00:14:55.390 --> 00:14:58.640
Whoo boy! It's okay if 
I cut loose with this?!

00:14:59.060 --> 00:15:01.360
It'll be more efficient if you link 
with Purple 2's control system

00:15:01.360 --> 00:15:03.540
than if we tried to manage it from here.

00:15:03.690 --> 00:15:05.230
I'm currently synchronizing with 
his Artillery Control System.

00:15:05.230 --> 00:15:06.820
Resetting the range of my radar.

00:15:07.280 --> 00:15:09.370
Tamaki has engaged in combat.

00:15:09.370 --> 00:15:10.660
She's up against...

00:15:10.660 --> 00:15:12.390
...the fighter that took out Patrick!

00:15:13.120 --> 00:15:16.460
Is that why Tamaki is so bent 
on goin' after that unit?

00:15:16.910 --> 00:15:19.710
But she's upsetting the enemy's 
formation in the process.

00:15:19.710 --> 00:15:22.250
It looks like the enemy is 
trying to protect that unit.

00:15:22.250 --> 00:15:23.770
Maybe some big shot is piloting it.

00:15:24.670 --> 00:15:26.550
Tamaki will never give up.

00:15:26.960 --> 00:15:28.150
If we play our cards right,

00:15:28.150 --> 00:15:29.610
we can throw the enemy 
into even more chaos.

00:15:29.840 --> 00:15:30.900
Cool!

00:15:31.030 --> 00:15:31.950
I'm on it!

00:15:38.430 --> 00:15:42.670
Aw, jeez! All you do is 
run around and around!

00:15:43.150 --> 00:15:46.590
Do you think you stand a chance 
if that's the fastest you can go?

00:15:53.280 --> 00:15:54.970
This dance is over.

00:15:57.450 --> 00:15:58.910
Tamaki, now is your chance!

00:15:58.910 --> 00:15:59.730
Got it!

00:16:07.000 --> 00:16:09.540
That attack was hardly beautiful.

00:16:09.540 --> 00:16:11.010
You are taking this too far.

00:16:11.260 --> 00:16:12.800
Focus on defending the gate.

00:16:12.800 --> 00:16:14.760
I'll leave that to you.

00:16:14.760 --> 00:16:17.160
I just managed to find 
a fascinating lamata.

00:16:17.320 --> 00:16:20.390
I take it you mean to 
defy King Galkie's will?

00:16:20.390 --> 00:16:22.270
I suppose I'd best go.

00:16:23.940 --> 00:16:25.610
Wait!

00:16:27.360 --> 00:16:30.050
Blue 1 will reach the 
finish line momentarily.

00:16:30.190 --> 00:16:31.880
You can do it! You're almost there!

00:16:51.760 --> 00:16:54.150
I wonder if you will 
show me a good time.

00:16:58.060 --> 00:17:00.590
Tamaki was just fighting 
this unit a minute ago...

00:17:00.590 --> 00:17:01.200
She couldn't be...!

00:17:14.610 --> 00:17:15.430
He dodged?!

00:17:22.870 --> 00:17:24.690
I won't let you get away!

00:17:26.420 --> 00:17:28.020
Tamaki, Ange! You're okay?

00:17:34.340 --> 00:17:36.290
Blue 1, I'll deal with this unit.

00:17:36.290 --> 00:17:37.570
Now hurry toward the gate!

00:17:37.760 --> 00:17:38.870
Roger that!

00:17:42.580 --> 00:17:45.240
Did you think that together 
the two of you could stall me?

00:17:52.720 --> 00:17:54.050
Damn it!

00:18:02.160 --> 00:18:04.140
You were fairly beautiful.

00:18:07.120 --> 00:18:07.900
Direct hit!

00:18:07.900 --> 00:18:11.730
Anticipated movement will be 
in the 2:20~2:25 direction.

00:18:21.730 --> 00:18:23.370
They're trying to snipe me?

00:18:39.240 --> 00:18:41.720
Pickled squid guts power!

00:18:57.510 --> 00:19:00.030
I really couldn't call that beautiful...

00:19:04.820 --> 00:19:05.870
Serves ya-

00:19:05.350 --> 00:19:07.140
The mission isn't over yet.

00:19:07.140 --> 00:19:10.080
The enemy fleets are converging 
over there. Hurry!

00:19:10.270 --> 00:19:11.330
Let's go!

00:19:20.630 --> 00:19:23.050
Go to Hell!

00:19:25.540 --> 00:19:28.390
Move it! Move! Move! Move!

00:19:33.250 --> 00:19:35.170
Go! Go, Blue 1!

00:19:35.170 --> 00:19:37.170
Blue 1 is approaching the finish line!

00:19:37.170 --> 00:19:38.440
The enemy is gathering to intercept.

00:19:38.670 --> 00:19:41.110
All ships, advance while 
continuing to fire!

00:19:43.600 --> 00:19:44.450
Asagi...

00:19:45.220 --> 00:19:47.020
The Straggle Laser's 
energy is fully charged.

00:19:47.020 --> 00:19:48.370
It's ready to fire at any time.

00:19:48.810 --> 00:19:52.020
Link the command sight to 
Blue 1's target marker.

00:19:52.020 --> 00:19:54.790
Fire at full power the second 
the marker makes contact.

00:19:57.280 --> 00:19:58.240
Asagi!

00:19:58.240 --> 00:19:59.720
Show 'em who's boss, Asagi!

00:20:01.410 --> 00:20:03.030
Go, Asagi! Don't screw this up!

00:20:04.620 --> 00:20:06.790
Blue 1 has reached the finish line!

00:20:07.160 --> 00:20:08.700
He will enter firing range momentarily.

00:20:08.700 --> 00:20:10.330
You can do it, Asagi.

00:20:12.670 --> 00:20:13.420
Asagi...

00:20:13.830 --> 00:20:15.250
Big Brother, fight!

00:20:15.250 --> 00:20:16.270
Fight!

00:20:43.280 --> 00:20:45.390
Go!

00:20:52.830 --> 00:20:53.770
We've caught the marker's signal.

00:20:54.170 --> 00:20:55.040
Fire!

00:21:06.390 --> 00:21:08.140
The energy we fired has vanished!

00:21:08.140 --> 00:21:09.390
The attack has been 
rendered ineffective.

00:21:09.390 --> 00:21:10.950
The gate appears to be undamaged.

00:21:11.140 --> 00:21:12.100
What?!

00:21:12.100 --> 00:21:13.120
No...

00:21:13.480 --> 00:21:14.810
Asagi...

00:21:15.690 --> 00:21:17.600
The Straggle Laser's shot is complete.

00:21:15.910 --> 00:21:17.040
What happened...?

00:21:17.040 --> 00:21:19.920
It appears they have developed 
a high-energy barrier.

00:21:17.600 --> 00:21:19.920
The enemy fleets appear 
to have taken damage.

00:21:20.200 --> 00:21:21.580
I never knew the gate 
had such a thing...!

00:21:20.210 --> 00:21:23.080
However, the gate itself 
is completely unharmed.

00:21:21.580 --> 00:21:23.920
A great many years have passed 
since we left the Wulgaru.

00:21:23.080 --> 00:21:25.600
Straggle Laser, all systems are normal.

00:21:23.920 --> 00:21:25.970
We should have expected them to

00:21:25.600 --> 00:21:28.140
We will hereby begin 
recharging the laser.

00:21:25.970 --> 00:21:28.140
change the system to some 
degree or another...

00:21:28.700 --> 00:21:31.080
What does it mean if there 
is a high-energy barrier?

00:21:31.080 --> 00:21:35.540
I suspect that it will render all 
energy-based weapons ineffective.

00:21:36.290 --> 00:21:38.540
We know that the marker hit its target.

00:21:38.540 --> 00:21:40.760
Regular artillery should 
still work on it.

00:21:40.760 --> 00:21:43.220
All of the ships have been 
equipped with missiles,

00:21:43.220 --> 00:21:44.770
but who is to say whether that will be

00:21:44.770 --> 00:21:46.310
enough to destroy 
something this massive?

00:21:50.350 --> 00:21:52.010
The attack didn't work?!

00:21:52.010 --> 00:21:53.230
Damn it all to hell!

00:21:53.230 --> 00:21:55.220
Why not? Hey, why not?

00:22:00.150 --> 00:22:03.630
You gave me a fright, 
but it's all over now.

00:22:06.410 --> 00:22:09.750
Crap! We're completely surrounded.

00:23:40.890 --> 00:23:55.910
"Arlea Yakuta Esto"
